-### Cost gate (`cost_gate.py`, v2 fix1)
-
-- `total_cost = spread + open_fee (buy legs) + close_fee + overnight + tax_est`, all ≥ 0, total > 0.
-  - spread = `max(spread_usd, (ask − bid) × units)`; final stage needs bid < ask and `quote_ts` ≤ 60 s (optional independent mark within 0.1%).
-  - fees from prepare/getCost — **required at the final stage** (no defaults). Preliminary only: 0.15% spread and $0.75 per order (real Classic fills 2026-10-07 ADBE/GS/CAT $500 each, keys).
-  - `tax_est = 25% × max(realized_pnl, 0)` on every sell leg (Israeli capital-gains rate).
-- Expected gain = directional EV, after tax (`× 0.75` when positive):
-  - RSI: `EV = units × [p(TP − ask) − (1 − p)(ask − SL)]`. `p` needs a cited source. Default = classic_rsi 1H backtest 12/19 = 0.632, **Wilson 95% lower bound 0.410** (in-sample, n=19). Break-even for the 1.5/2.0 ATR bracket is 0.4286, so with the default p every RSI pack is `COST_GATE_SKIP` until better (cited) evidence is supplied via `--p-hit/--p-source`.
-  - Rebalance add / trim / sell / rotation: an `edge` dict is required — `method ∈ {rs_expected_return, trend_expected_return}`, `expected_return_pct`, `horizon_days`, `evidence{source, n}` (rotation also `held_expected_return_pct`). Add: notional × er; trim/sell: −notional × er_held; rotation (one combined gate, `legs[]`): buy_notional × (er_new − er_held). No edge → SKIP. Typed USD gains are not accepted.
-- Verdict **PASS** iff `EV_after_tax ≥ 2 × total_cost` and net > 0; **COST_GATE_SKIP** otherwise; **COST_GATE_INVALID** on bad/missing inputs (negative fees/units, p ∉ (0,1), bid ≥ ask, stale/missing quote, assumed inputs at final, total ≤ 0); **RISK_EXIT** for listed hard risk exits (numbers still recorded).
-- `do_not_place=True` keeps meaning “this script never places”; `auto_place_eligible` requires a preliminary PASS, and a `--force` auto run is never eligible.
+   Checks (fail closed): pack_id regex; US regular session; book ≤ 60 s, `0 ≤ cash ≤ equity`; verdicts as above; instrument guard; live quote ≤ 60 s **and a second-source `--mark` within 0.1%**; live ask within 0.1% of the QA anchor; `cash − units×ask − open_fee ≥ 2500` at anchor and live ask; caps on market value **and** cost basis; min $400; anchor gate PASS (QA-recomputed) **and** live gate PASS; MCP payload verified against the prepare response (account, instrumentId, direction `buy`, leverage 1, `mkt`, units ±1e-6, SL/TP, prepare stop bounds); 0 < SL < bid; rebalance buys: `ask − 3.5×ATRd ≤ SL ≤ ask − 1×ATRd` or ETF 8% / stock 10–12% trailing; no position on the instrument opened < 24 h; sell legs: position held, `positionId` int, realized PnL recomputed from openRate (|Δ| ≤ $1, tax on the max); risk exits recomputed from book/scores/live (never self-declared); locks keyed on (run_id, symbol, instrumentId) or (kind, legs, ET date) plus per-leg same-day locks.
